 * The app icons. Each one is a 24x24 vector outline (Material Symbols, Apache 2.0) kept as path data,
 * so no icon library is needed and every tool gets its own distinct glyph.
 * A leading "E|" in the data means the shape uses the even-odd fill rule.
 */
